== Description ==
Increases click profits depending on level, and autoclicks 1 times per second for each 20 levels.

Gains [[Experience#Pet Experience|experience]] from her autoclicks, even when offline.

A relatively easy pet to unlock early in the game, the Pixie is a perfect companion for the [[Druid]], as they both synergize with autoclicks and [[criticals]].

== Pet Abilities ==
The Pixie has 2 abilities.

1. Autoclicks:

* <math>1 + \left\lfloor\frac{L}{20}\right\rfloor</math> times per second
* with <math>\text{Click Profit}\ =\ \text{Hero Click Profit}</math>
* with <math>\text{Crit Chance} = \frac{ \text{Hero Crit Chance} }{2}</math>
* with <math>\text{Crit Profit}\ =\ \text{Hero Crit Profit}</math>

where:<br>
<math>L = \text{Pixie Level}</math>

2. Multiplies click profits by:
<br><math>L \times P + 1</math>
<br>where:
* <math>L = \text{Pixie Level}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Modifier}</math>

== Experience Gain ==
The Pixie gains experience from her autoclicks, earning this amount per click:
<br><math>(1 + F) \times M</math>
<br>where:
*<math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
*<math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>

